{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Inspect one spare part's price, supply and fitment evidence after search_parts; use prepare_part_handoff for a human enquiry.\n\n- part_id selects one catalogue record, not the OEM-number group. If several records share an OEM reference, select the buyer's intended record before lookup; never combine one record's price with another's stock or fitment.\n- A found record can remain unsellable. Read its minimum quantity and required fitment fields before proposing a purchase; missing price or stock means unknown, not zero. An OEM match does not certify fitment.\n- This anonymous lookup refreshes the selected record without reserving supply. If it is missing, search again and reconfirm any replacement with the buyer; a failed lookup does not prove the OEM part unavailable everywhere.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"part_id":{"description":"Exact catalogue part_id copied from search_parts, e.g. BRK-AXIO-01. This is JOY's catalogue identifier, not an OEM part number or a product URL.","maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["part_id"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_part","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"classification":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"classification_status":{"type":"string"},"installation_type":{"type":"string"},"product_type":{"type":"string"},"universal_accessory":{"type":"boolean"},"universal_constraints_verified":{"type":"boolean"},"universal_search_eligible":{"type":"boolean"},"vehicle_specific":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"constraints":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"constraint_type":{"type":"string"},"required_fields":{"items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":16,"type":"array"},"status":{"type":"string"},"verified":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"error":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"error":{"minLength":1,"type":"st